<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Guinness Peat half yr net profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Guinness Peat half yr net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30</p>
<p>	   (million pounds sterling unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    11.52 vs 5.88</p>
<p>    Net					9.77 vs 6.93</p>
<p>    Dividend (pence)			nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Sales				   41.20 vs 30.64</p>
<p>    Shr (pence)			    1.23 vs 1.02</p>
<p>    Tax					1.39 vs 0.06</p>
<p>    Interest				 0.55 vs 0.64</p>
<p>    Minorities			     2.46 vs 1.38</p>
<p>NOTE: Guinness Peat Group Plc is an investment company. The 1995/96 half result includes a profit on the disposal of businesses of 0.19 million stg compared to a profit of 1.62 million in the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
